  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This serves 4 and takes about 1 hour. The key thing to watch is the seasoning: pepper soup should have a warming heat from the black pepper and chilli that builds slowly as you eat, not a sharp upfront burn. Taste and adjust at the end."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The broth should be clear and golden, not thick. If your stock is too cloudy, let the soup rest and ladle from the top. A clear, fragrant bowl is the goal."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
